Subject: [PATCH] Preserve descriptor pointee views through typed helper inlining

Use one shared raw layout for proven device/constant descriptor roots and
cloned helper proxies while retaining every load/store type and byte cursor.
Keep conflicting local or ambiguous pointers behind their typed boundary.
Compute caller roots lazily once instead of scanning ordinary value helpers.

